WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.583
Coach, our flight to Mexico City

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:03.500
doesn’t leave for another 10 hours!

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.083
Hey, you gotta be prepared for everything

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:06.166
I DID IT AGAIN

00:00:06.416 --> 00:00:07.458
I DIDN’T LEAVE ENOUGH TIME

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:08.416
GO. GO. GO. 

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:08.791
HURRY

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.875
WOW, NO TRAFFIC!!!!

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:16.416
Let’s practice the Spanish I made you all learn

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.875
Dónde esta la end zone?

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:21.708
Aqui esta la end zone

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:22.500
LEAVE ALL YOUR STUFF

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.583
 WE’LL GET MORE KANSAS CITY

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:24.541
BARBECUE IN MEXICO

00:00:24.541 --> 00:00:25.416
Yo, I hope it’s cool

00:00:25.416 --> 00:00:26.500
but I have like 20 carry-ons

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.083
I’m detecting a lot of weapons

00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:30.708
HEY EVERYBODY, THE CHIEFS ARE HERE!

00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:32.875
I think we have two potentially explosive offenses

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:34.083
RPO! RPO!

00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:35.291
ATTENTION

00:00:35.291 --> 00:00:36.250
THE GAME IN MEXICO CITY 

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:39.125
THE FLIGHT IS LEAVING RIGHT NOW

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:39.625
Better hurry

00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:41.375
I think I have a game script for this somewhere

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:42.791
I have the perfect play

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:45.416
Oh God, they’re both so innovative

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.625
Hey man, we’re the same!

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:48.041
We’re both front-runners!

00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:49.708
I am very clearly in front of you

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.000
We made it!

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.208
HELL YEAH! LET’S GO!

00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:53.291
Come on, Travis, get on the plane

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:55.125
MAN, TRAVELING IS SO STRESS-FREE

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:56.958
LOOK AT ALL THIS LEG ROOM!

00:00:57.583 --> 00:00:58.541
MY DEFENSE!

00:00:58.541 --> 00:01:00.000
Always an afterthought

